# DevNote Reference

Use this file only when `devnote_main.mdc` is not enough. Source of truth remains `Packages/com.devnote`.

## Paths
- Bootstrap prefab: `Assets/- Project -/Resources/- ProjectContext -.prefab`.
- Project context code: `Assets/- Project -/Context`.
- Project configs: `Assets/- Project -/Resources`, accessed via `Configs`.
- Audio config example: `Configs.AudioHub`.

## Scene and context
- Root groups: `= World`, `= UI`, `= Context`.
- Decorator naming: `[Button]`, `<Text>`, `*Particle*`, `=Container=`, `>Point<`.
- `ContextStartup` creates `ProjectContext`, registers all `SceneContext` objects, then adds runtime `Context`.
- `ProjectContext` initializes services in this order: `IEnvironment` -> `IRemote` -> `ISave` / `IAds` / `IPurchase` / `IAnalytics` / `IReview` / `ILeaderboards` -> `Sound` / tables / localization.
- `ServiceSelector` picks the first service with `ISelectableService.IsAvailableForSelection == true`.

## MainSceneContext pattern
```csharp
public class MainSceneContext : SceneContext
{
    public override void RegisterContext()
    {
        IRemote.SetDefaultHandler(RemoteKey.Test, () => TestType.ABA.ToString());

        // var controller = Register(new SomeController(...));
        Initialized = true;
    }
}
```

